  "details": "t is not appropriate that group icon and banner data is stored in the gallery of the user who uploaded it, rather than in the group.\n\nThis would cause trouble.\n\nCan you make it so that group icons and group banners are stored in the group?\n\nIt can be reproduced by following the steps below.\n\n1: Upload images for the group icon and banner\n\n2: Delete those images from the gallery of the user who uploaded them\n\n3: The group icons and banners corresponding to the deleted images will no longer be displayed\n\nThis is not about VRC+. It's about where the group icon and banner data is stored.",
